@startuml

skinparam backgroundColor #EFF1F5
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #4C4F69
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam arrow {
    Color #1E66F5
    FontColor #6C6F85
    FontSize 9
}

skinparam sequence {
    LifeLineBorderColor #1E66F5
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #E6E9EF
    ParticipantBorderColor #1E66F5
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontColor #4C4F69
    GroupBackgroundColor #E6E9EF
    GroupBorderColor #1E66F5
    GroupFontColor #4C4F69
    BoxBackgroundColor #E6E9EF
    BoxBorderColor #8839EF
    BoxFontColor #4C4F69
}


autonumber "<b>[00]</b>"

actor "Analista SOC" as User
participant "Leptos WASM\n(LoginView)" as UI
participant "Axum API Router\n(/api/v1/auth)" as API
participant "Security Engine\n(Argon2id & TOTP)" as Sec
participant "UsersRepository\n(SQLx Pool)" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL 15\n(user_sessions)" as DB

User -> UI: Ingresa username, password y código TOTP
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/v1/auth/login {user, pwd, totp}
activate API

API -> Sec: Verificar Rate Limiting (IP / User)
activate Sec
Sec --> API: OK (Intentos fallidos < 5)
deactivate Sec

API -> Repo: find_by_username(username)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM sys_users WHERE username = $1
activate DB
DB --> Repo: sys_user record (con password_hash)
deactivate DB
Repo --> API: Option<User>
deactivate Repo

API -> Sec: verify_password(hash, plain_pwd)
activate Sec
Sec --> API: true (Argon2id validado)
API -> Sec: verify_totp_code(secret, totp_code)
Sec --> API: true (Ventana RFC 6238 OK)
deactivate Sec

alt ¿Requiere rotación obligatoria de contraseña?
    API --> UI: HTTP 403 Forbidden {force_password_change: true}
    UI --> User: Muestra modal de rotación forzada ISO 27001
else Credenciales y 2FA Válidos
    API -> Sec: generate_session_token()
    activate Sec
    Sec --> API: token_opaco_64_caracteres
    deactivate Sec

    API -> Repo: create_session(UserSession)
    activate Repo
    Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO user_sessions (session_id, user_id, expires_at)\nVALUES ($1, $2, NOW() + 24h)
    activate DB
    DB --> Repo: OK
    deactivate DB
    Repo --> API: Ok(())
    deactivate Repo

    API --> UI: HTTP 200 OK {token, role, timeout_secs: 300}
    deactivate API
    UI --> User: Redirige al Dashboard SOC con sesión activa
    deactivate UI
end

@enduml